name: kirupa-24
size: 24
essence: Kirupa: a big toothy grin and dark brows under short black hair
keep: short slate-black hair cap with an arched inked fringe, a big toothy grin, warm brown sampled skin, ears below the short sides, thick dark straight brows
drop: nose, stubble, the surprised moment, pointing hand, tee shirt, background, flash lighting
view: front
note: round 3. r3: a blind reviewer said the grin might resemble a beard or mask at 1x, so the chin under the mouth is lit like the template (row 20 s at x8-13) instead of a solid shade band. r2: the jaw narrows below the mouth (rows 19-22: x5, x6, x7-8, chin x9-14) for the oval face in the photos and in the 16. r1: the fringe ink rises a row (row 7) so slate brows fit on row 10 with a skin row above the 2x3 eyes; a 3-row toothy smile like the 16 (corners x7 and x16, teeth x9-14).
rev: 3
template: person-head-24

[palette]
H #66717c hair light (slate, upper left)
h #3a4148 hair base (slate)
d #30363c hair shade
k #262b30 hair deep shade and brows (slate shadow)
S #e2ac8e skin light (upper-left rim)
s #cb8d71 skin base (a lit mid-tone cluster of the bio photo's cheek)
t #b47058 skin shade (lower-right rim)
u #9d5541 skin deep shade
w #ffffff teeth

